{"about_the_game":"A remote island, besieged by the dead.<br><br>A shipwrecked traveler, plagued by lost memories.<br><br>A mysterious witch, in a realm between life and death. <br><br>Her motives are hazy. But the offer is simple: become her champion, and bring hell to her enemies. In exchange, you\u2019ll gain a power others would kill for:<br><br>The chance to live again.<br><br>Now, cast headlong into a power struggle that threatens to upend the world, it's up to you to assemble your party, blaze a trail, and uncover the memories of your former life.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/Turn-base-Tactical-Action.gif?t=1736359678\" /><br>Craft your moves and crush your foes, with crunchy grid-based combat that's fast and mean. Face off against a variety of enemies, from crazed Imperial cultists to the flesh-hungry Fallen, most of whom will wreck your day before you can blink.<br><br>That is, unless you take advantage of all the tools at your disposal: persistent upgrades, environmental hazards, elemental interactions, weapon affinities, skill synergies, and more!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/Shifting-Paths-And-Chance-Events.gif?t=1736359678\" /><br>The road to your enemies' door is long and treacherous, and no two journeys are alike. Choose your path and navigate choice-driven random encounters that can either lend you the advantage, or rip it cruelly away.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/Customize_Strategize.gif?t=1736359678\" /><br>Tackle challenges your way, with 9 playable characters, dozens of persistent upgrades, over 200 unique skills, and 30+ game-changing Relics. <br><br>If at first you don't succeed: die, die again.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/A-tale-of-Lost-Souls.gif?t=1736359678\" /><br>As you journey across the island, you'll meet a crew of misfits and killers battling demons of their own. Grow your bonds, learn their stories, and help them regain the things they've lost.<br><br>But it\u2019s not all about other people. Each time you die, you\u2019ll also collect new shards of your own memory, and slowly piece together the puzzle of the life you lost\u2026 and the man you came here searching for\u2026","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Journey's Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/d23a8597d8aac03e05c6a341774250b0e51f1ae1.jpg"},{"name":"Immortal Alchemist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/459083031f72d2fa64fbfba594a3509b9572381e.jpg"},{"name":"Death Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/501c5c6a82569ee98da317a678811fd11447a3df.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow Warrior","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/20e754320214da55f05fda76f1fa1b3cdae4f6e0.jpg"},{"name":"Beyond the Veil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/c8c1276c0104f5c3d4732ea6670d435dfb11c67d.jpg"},{"name":"Setting Things Right","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/620b41239077f714ce671c4c7f8083e33ed7bedc.jpg"},{"name":"Spellslingers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/45e9d6da519ffa89481a26abeb55694224aa9500.jpg"},{"name":"Bladestorm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/c7fe731ce03d70b73108f48f06578c12fffebb1b.jpg"},{"name":"Long Odds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/8064efb47fa0b97ec9db6cafbe10a9dc91597e35.jpg"},{"name":"Grand Company","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2530490/653b13960f76dd20c0c319c85f15ad2c343e0abd.jpg"}],"total":50},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530490?t=1736359678","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2530490?t=1736359678","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/d33c16f6d09b514d3e6da6707043cbf9f6e9716e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1736359678","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/d33c16f6d09b514d3e6da6707043cbf9f6e9716e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1736359678","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3074170,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/Steam-Embed-Roadmap-01-Winter-Lit-EN.png?t=1736359678\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>A remote island, besieged by the dead.<br><br>A shipwrecked traveler, plagued by lost memories.<br><br>A mysterious witch, in a realm between life and death. <br><br>Her motives are hazy. But the offer is simple: become her champion, and bring hell to her enemies. In exchange, you\u2019ll gain a power others would kill for:<br><br>The chance to live again.<br><br>Now, cast headlong into a power struggle that threatens to upend the world, it's up to you to assemble your party, blaze a trail, and uncover the memories of your former life.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/Turn-base-Tactical-Action.gif?t=1736359678\" /><br>Craft your moves and crush your foes, with crunchy grid-based combat that's fast and mean. Face off against a variety of enemies, from crazed Imperial cultists to the flesh-hungry Fallen, most of whom will wreck your day before you can blink.<br><br>That is, unless you take advantage of all the tools at your disposal: persistent upgrades, environmental hazards, elemental interactions, weapon affinities, skill synergies, and more!<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/Shifting-Paths-And-Chance-Events.gif?t=1736359678\" /><br>The road to your enemies' door is long and treacherous, and no two journeys are alike. Choose your path and navigate choice-driven random encounters that can either lend you the advantage, or rip it cruelly away.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/Customize_Strategize.gif?t=1736359678\" /><br>Tackle challenges your way, with 9 playable characters, dozens of persistent upgrades, over 200 unique skills, and 30+ game-changing Relics. <br><br>If at first you don't succeed: die, die again.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/extras/A-tale-of-Lost-Souls.gif?t=1736359678\" /><br>As you journey across the island, you'll meet a crew of misfits and killers battling demons of their own. Grow your bonds, learn their stories, and help them regain the things they've lost.<br><br>But it\u2019s not all about other people. Each time you die, you\u2019ll also collect new shards of your own memory, and slowly piece together the puzzle of the life you lost\u2026 and the man you came here searching for\u2026","developers":["Ocean Drive Studio, Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530490/header.jpg?t=1736359678","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"<i>(c) 202